y.","op":"insert","after":19,"html":"<p>Autolink <a href=\"https://example.com/a_b_c\">https://example.com/a_b_c</a> and <a href=\"http://www.example.com/x~y\">www.example.com/x~y</a>.</p>","cjk":false,"kind":"paragraph"},{"slot":21,"src":"HTML entity &copy; and &lt;tag&gt; text.","op":"insert","after":20,"html":"<p>HTML entity © and &lt;tag&gt; text.</p>","cjk":false,"kind":"paragraph"},{"slot":22,"src":"Hard break  \nhere and `code with \\[ ] ~~ $`.","op":"insert","after":21,"html":"<p>Hard break<br>here and <code>code with \\[ ] ~~ $</code>.</p>","cjk":false,"kind":"paragraph"},{"slot":23,"src":"Inline \\$5 and 10\\$, \\$a\\$ b, `$x$` and \\$\\$c\\$\\$ end, a \\$ alone. Tilde ~single and ~~struck~~ text.","op":"insert","after":22,"html":"<p>Inline $5 and 10$, $a$ b, <code>$x$</code> and $$c$$ end, a $ alone. Tilde ~single and <del>struck</del> text.</p>","cjk":false,"kind":"paragraph"},{"slot":24,"src":"Brackets [a] alone, a\\](b) and a\\][c] here; \\![x] and wow! [real](https://example.com/r) link.","op":"insert","after":23,"html":"<p>Brackets [a] alone, a](b) and a][c] here; ![x] and wow! <a href=\"https://example.com/r\">real</a> link.</p>","cjk":false,"kind":"paragraph"},{"slot":25,"src":"- The `HEALTHCHECK_MODE` variable supports three modes:\n  - `dkg` -- succeeds when the key exists.\n  - `p2p` -- succeeds when port 30303 is open.\n  - `ready` -- succeeds when both hold.","op":"insert","after":24,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-first\"><li>The <code>HEALTHCHECK_MODE</code> variable supports three modes:\n<ul><li><code>dkg</code> -- succeeds when the key exists.</li><li><code>p2p</code> -- succeeds when port 30303 is open.</li><li><code>ready</code> -- succeeds when both hold.</li></ul></li></ul>","cjk":false,"kind":"listItem"},{"slot":26,"src":"- Second item with sub-points:\n  1. first \\[n\\](m) point\n  2. second \\~x\\~ point","op":"insert","after":25,"tight":true,"html":"<ul class=\"li-block li-last\"><li>Second item with sub-points:\n<ol><li>first [n](m) point</li><li>second ~x~ point</li></ol></li></ul>","cjk":false,"kind":"listItem"},{"slot":27,"src":"After paragraph here.","op":"insert","after":26,"html":"<p>After paragraph here.</p>","cjk":false,"kind":"paragraph"}],"title":"Escapes","marks":[],"deletions":[],"rewrite":false,"version":1,"tasks":{"total":0,"done":0},"reset":true}